<font class="pn-normal"><a href="user.php?op=userinfo&amp;uname=mstewa">mstewa</a> _WRITES "<br><br /><br /><br />Folks, <br /><br /><br /><br /><br /><br />Here’s the latest news from Mythic. As you have already discovered, we’ve had a few things up our collective sleeves the last few weeks. As I’ve hinted at before, this was not the first time nor will it be the last time that we do something like this. We have lots of other surprises coming the road in the next few months (though by then very few will be surprises) but we hope you like them. So, let’s get this update started off on the right hoof. "<br>
